{"id":"d4c74ee3ac7a06bb","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-unbounded.md","title":"Unbounded Set","display":"df-unbounded — Unbounded Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-unbounded","aliases":["58-df-unbounded"],"display":"df-unbounded — Unbounded Set","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-subset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-unbounded"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-unbounded</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-unbounded — Unbounded Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d35b78cf8312c12b\" href=\"?note=d35b78cf8312c12b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-subset.md\">../batch09/58-df-subset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(S\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span>（见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d35b78cf8312c12b\" href=\"?note=d35b78cf8312c12b\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-subset.md\">../batch09/58-df-subset.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（本原子定义的无界谓词）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unbounded}\\vdash \\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in S\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unbounded}\\vdash \\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha&lt;\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in S\\;(\\alpha&lt;\\beta)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对极限序数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，该条件等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup S=\\kappa\">\\(\\sup S=\\kappa\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>“无界”总是相对于给定序数或基数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> 而言。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d35b78cf8312c12b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-subset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-subset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d35b78cf8312c12b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S\\subseteq\\kappa$（见 [[../batch09/58-df-subset.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}unbounded}\\vdash \\mathrm{Unbounded}_S(S,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\subseteq\\kappa\\land S\\subseteq\\kappa\\land\\forall\\alpha<\\kappa\\;\\exists\\beta\\in S\\;(\\alpha<\\beta)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup S=\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false}],"bytes":896,"backlinks":[{"id":"761f22510c77faaf","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Unbounded}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[../batch17/58-df-unbounded.md]])."},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-165","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-unbounded]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1344","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-unbounded.md|58-df-unbounded]]（batch17）"},{"id":"7334957c6d59eacc","anchor":"ref-126","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-def-operator.md]]\n[[58-df-l-hierarchy.md]]\n[[58-df-p-name.md]]\n[[58-df-aleph.md]]\n[[58-df-antichain.md]]\n[[58-df-baire-property.md]]\n[[58-df-beth-function.md]]\n[[58-df-bijective.md]]\n[[58-df-borel.md]]\n[[58-df-bounded.md]]\n[[58-df-branch.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinal.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinaladd.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinalclass.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinalexpp.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinality.md]]\n[[58-df-cardinalmul.md]]\n[[58-df-cartesian.md]]\n[[58-df-cauchy.md]]\n[[58-df-cauchyseq.md]]\n[[58-df-ch.md]]\n[[58-df-chain.md]]\n[[58-df-closed.md]]\n[[58-df-club-filter.md]]\n[[58-df-club.md]]\n[[58-df-cofinality.md]]\n[[58-df-compatible.md]]\n[[58-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[58-df-continuous.md]]\n[[58-df-continuum.md]]\n[[58-df-countable.md]]\n[[58-df-critical-point.md]]\n[[58-df-ctm.md]]\n[[58-df-dedekind-cut.md]]\n[[58-df-dense.md]]\n[[58-df-diamond.md]]\n[[58-df-diff.md]